{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30594","headline":"蠡泽旅怀 · 林滋","name":"蠡泽旅怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁言行旅日，况复桃花时。\n水即沧溟远，星从天汉垂。\n川光独鸟暮，林色落英迟。\n岂是王程急，偏多游子悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林滋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}